  "details": [
    "Human decision: two forecast producers with one combined account plan and one manually started Atlas executor after verified cutover.",
    "Accepted Scout joint_capital_plan and joint_capital_handoff implementations are unchanged at reviewed9c5b502; the native account path invokes composition once and preserves its joint identities.",
    "Source-only native preparation, immutable local input registration, one fresh account snapshot, conditional planning proceeds, filtered shared-cash views and original-source accuracy aggregation are implemented.",
    "Pre-submission cash reservations, native ownership, conservative partial/uncertain submission handling and producer execution fencing are covered by offline tests.",
    "Added register-inputs, register-accuracy and select-view operations; complete immutable inputs must arrive through separately authorized artifact supervision.",
    "Frozen historical stage lists and deadlines, sparse-price lookback, model abstentions, native source/quote/risk controls and fallback rules are preserved."
